# Machine-specific env vars and PATH additions live here.
# Sourced by every shell (interactive + non-interactive) if present, but is gitignored.
# Copy to ~/.zshenv.local and edit:
#
#   cp ~/code/dotfiles/zsh/.zshenv.local.example ~/.zshenv.local
#
# Use this for things editors/scripts need to see:
#   - API keys / tokens
#   - Per-machine PATH entries (work tools, custom installs)
#   - Per-machine env vars
# Interactive-only tweaks (aliases, prompt, plugins) go in ~/.zshrc.local instead.

